  "about_item": [
    "Wood Drafting Table: This art table is constructed of durable steel and wood, sturdy and durable. The artist desk provides a stable platform and smooth work surface for creative pursuits. The triangle legs provide stable support. The professional drawing table is great for architects and hobbyists",
    "Height and Angle Adjustable: The height of this painting table can be adjusted from 28 inch to 35.8 inch with the knob on the leg allowing you to find the perfect position whether standing or sitting. Tilt the top surface(0-60 degrees) to your desired angle for optimal comfort and productivity",
    "Double Tabletop: The drafting desk has a main wood tabletop 34 inch by 23.6 inch, big enough for your drafting, painting and other work. There is also a small slide-out tray providing a 15 inch by 23.6 inch surface for sketching, drafting, or laptop use. Ideal for artists, architects, and designers",
    "Large Storage Space: The painting table have 2 slide-out drawers and a storage shelf under the main table to store papers, drafting tools and other stuff. There is a pencil box on the right hand side. When the desktop is tilted, the Pencil Ledge on the table can ensure the pencil and drawing paper do not fall",
    "Multi-purpose Desk: The main drawing desk can be tilted up according to your art work need. Adjust flat, it is a versatile table to read, write or do computer work. This adjustable hobby desk offers a spacious work surface, and a comfortable 20 inch high stool for painting, sketching, sculpting or other art projects"
  ],
